   "text": "Three TLS legs, one cert per app on legs \u2460 and \u2461\n\u2460 client \u2192 HAProxy: app cert (public trust)\n\u2461 HAProxy \u2192 agent: same app cert, verified with ca-file\n\u2462 agent \u2192 backend: backend cert, verified by NGINX\nRotation = push to every node, validate, graceful reload",
